Date: Tue, 16 Jun 2026 22:58:27 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 02206/11362] [outer-loop] STRONGER explorer (systematic
 frontier BFS) SOLVES ls20 adapter-free

graph_explore_solve_v2: directed state-transition graph + shortest-path to untested
state-actions (replay-navigation) -- toward SOTA arXiv:2512.24156. Solves ls20 L1
adapter-free (13 actions); the standing loop then captures the trajectory ->
reproduction-gates (offline_reproduced=True) -> trains a verifier-seed -> persists the
adapter seed, NO per-game RE. Adapter-free first contact now WORKS. Remaining: r11l
needs exact-coord click candidates (centroids miss); wa30 ~33-deep needs a value
heuristic. Wired into arc_loop_solve.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
